{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のちはるーむではボードゲームをしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はよいふろの日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よい(4)ふ(2)ろ(6)の語呂合わせから。\n確かに今日はいつもより6時間くらい\n早くお風呂に入ったし\nお風呂に入ると疲れ取れるよね〜っていう\n話を友達と偶然してたし\nよいふろの日にぴったりな行動してたかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界で一番大切な私達の愛犬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/26/1222765/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/26/1222765/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜の季節に撮った、\nこの写真大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃん横向いてるけど...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃん、何故かとても\n写真映りが凄い悪いし\n写真撮ろうとしてもそっぽ向いちゃうの〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然前向いた！って思っても\nちょうど目瞑ってたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この鈍臭さがまた可愛いんだよなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/26/1222765/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパーマンさくら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巷で話題になってるのを嗅ぎつけて\nこれはさくちゃんにも着せたい！\nと思ってお父さんと即決。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて可愛いんだろう...\n親バカ...犬バカ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/26/1222765/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに抱っこされるさくら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前足の感じと、\n後ろ足をクロスしている感じが\nたまらなく可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃんは斎藤家の永遠の癒し\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとお家にいてほしいな◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひまわりの約束」秦基博さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットを飼っている皆さん\n\"君\"をペットだと思って聞いてみて。\n涙が溢れてくるほど\n改めて素敵な曲だと気付けるから。\n\"そばにいること\nなにげない この瞬間も\n忘れはしないよ\"\n私達より圧倒的に寿命の短いペット達。\n一緒にいられる時間は\n本当に大切にしたいな。\n大好きな曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかい季節。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ薄手のコートもいらないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}